  "description": "Authenticated session ingress accepts A/r1 then B/r3, retains delayed A/r2 only inside an atomically audited outer quarantine with no session-state append, materializes B/r3, agrees across hot/replay state, and permits only newer adapter/runtime generations to reset local revision.",
