  "invariant_check": "SessionReportSourceOrdering: pending source evidence older than the current runtime/adapter/revision tuple is inert for session mutation and is retained only inside an atomic outer quarantine; accepted newer evidence atomically advances the full report and watermark, and authenticated adapter/runtime replacement alone may reset revision to one."
